‑bio bridge is limited to tool use rather than a central multimodal model.",INCLUDE,,,,,,,"The abstract describes GeneGPT, a novel method that augments an LLM with NCBI API calls to answer genomics questions, indicating a substantive natural‑language component and a direct text‑to‑biology bridge centered on genomic data. | The abstract presents GeneGPT with an augmented decoding algorithm that generates answers and triggers API calls, confirming a generative architecture, and leverages a large language model across eight biomedical tasks, indicating foundation-model-like breadth.",wrapper_boundary;generative_boundary
