torial","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a bibliometric and visual analysis of AI in chronic kidney disease, not an original model paper. It surveys trends in published work rather than describing a generative foundation model.","evidence_snippet":"\"Bibliometric and visual analysis of trends and future directions\" and \"888 relevant publications were analyzed\""},{"record_id":"rec_000040","paper_type":"benchmark_resource","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"benchmark_resource","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract describes a workshop outcome and a community portal, PlantSCHub, rather than a model. It is a resource paper focused on shared tools and workflows, not generative model evidence.","evidence_snippet":"\"we established PlantSCHub, a community-curated web portal that aggregates protocols, datasets, and tutorials\""}]}
