pathology foundation model is used as an encoder only.","evidence_snippet":"“WSIs were encoded via a pathology foundation model and integrated with clinical variables”"},{"record_id":"rec_000114","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a primary multimodal representation-learning framework combining microscopy and perturbational transcriptomics, not a text-bio model. The only foundation-model mention is a fine-tuned single-cell encoder used in the teacher.","evidence_snippet":"“an intervention-aware distillation framework” and “the teacher employs a fine-tuned single-cell foundation model”"},{"record_id":"rec_000115","paper_type":"application_wrapper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"yes","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"application_wrapper","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract centers on an LLM-driven pipeline for PTM detection and structural interpretation, which reads as wrapper-style use of existing language models rather than a new text-bio foundation model. The bridge is between proteomics and structural modeling, not text and biology.","evidence_snippet":"“generative AI-driven pipeline” and “leverages large language models to identify, annotate, and interpret candidate PTMs”"},{"record_id":"rec_000118","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","generative_model_present":"yes","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"none","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The paper introduces CodonMoE as a new adapter for DNA language models and shows codon-level mapping to RNA prediction tasks. The abstract explicitly frames the work in language-model terms and a cross-modality sequence-to-sequence bridge.","evidence_snippet":"“DNA language models” and “transforms DNA language models into effective RNA analyzers”"}]}
